6. Rewrite the following professional `if-else-if` ladder using an equivalent `switch` statement in Java:
```java
char tariffSlab = 'C';

if (tariffSlab == 'D') {
    System.out.println("Domestic Residential: ₹ 5.50 / Unit");
} else if (tariffSlab == 'C') {
    System.out.println("Commercial Enterprise: ₹ 9.00 / Unit");
} else if (tariffSlab == 'I') {
    System.out.println("Heavy Industrial Factory: ₹ 12.50 / Unit");
} else {
    System.out.println("Standard Public Utility");
}
```

